# Bottom line

The Fu-Yau/K3 candidate should now be carried forward in this corrected form:

```text
not as a determinant-seven pair of anti-self-dual H^2 curvatures,
but as a determinant-seven positive block in the algebraic Mukai charge lattice.
```

That is the cleanest way to keep the `Z_7` arithmetic while avoiding the K3
root-wall obstruction.
